/a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 2</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Unlike the normal <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour_(Condition)\" title=\"Mage Armour (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mage Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Mage_Armour_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mage_Armour_(Condition)\" title=\"Mage Armour (Condition)\">Mage Armour</a> condition, this stacks with armour instead of setting a base Armour Class.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Rolan.27s_Mage_Armour\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Rolan's_Mage_Armour\">Sources of Rolan's Mage Armour</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rolan%27s_Mage_Armour\" title=\"Rolan's Mage Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Rolan%27s_Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/30px-Rolan%27s_Mage_Armour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Rolan%27s_Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/45px-Rolan%27s_Mage_Armour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Rolan%27s_Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/60px-Rolan%27s_Mage_Armour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rolan's Mage Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Rolan%27s_Mage_Armour_Icon.webp/30px-Rolan%27s_Mage_Armour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Rolan%27s_Mage_Armour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Rolan%27s_Mage_Armour\" title=\"Rolan's Mage Armour\">Rolan's Mage Armour</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>MAGE_ARMOR</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Mage_Armour\">\n\n<th scope=\"